title: 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_영문
---
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: Oh, it's {name()}!
(As I entered the lecture hall, I ran into EunPyo.)
{name()}: Hey.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Are you here with anyone? Want to sit next to me?
(The seat next to EunPyo is empty.)
{name()}: Sure, sounds good.
(I sat next to EunPyo and took out my laptop.)
(EunPyo is also opening her laptop.)
EunPyo: You know, I really like this professor. She's so kind.
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: I took one of her classes last semester, and she was so good at explaining things I didn't get...
<<choice 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_긍1_영문 "I like this professor too." 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_부1_영문 "Really? Honestly, I'm not a fan...">>
(EunPyo continues to praise the professor.)
===

title: 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_긍1_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
<<show pyo_smile>>
{name()}: I like this professor too.
{name()}: She gives good grades and doesn't give too many assignments...
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Right? I almost want to start a fan club for her.
(EunPyo seems to be in a good mood.)
<<jump 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_부1_영문
---
<<dislike 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo -5>>
{name()}: Really? Honestly, I'm not a fan...
{name()}: I took her class before and ended up having to retake it.
{name()}: I don't have very good memories...
<<show pyo_shock>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: Whaaat?
EunPyo: No way.
<<show pyo_neg2>>
EunPyo: Well, it's a good thing we're taking it together this time. I'll help you change those memories.
{name()}: I'm a bit worried, but... okay, I guess...
<<jump 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_분기1_영문
---
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: It's nice having a friend to take class with.  
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: Taking classes alone can get a bit lonely.
{name()}: Same here.
(Just then, EunPyo's laptop screen catches my eye.)
(Her wallpaper is quite striking. It's a drawing of three 2D girls.)
<<if get("otk") >= 2>>
    (They are the main characters from the anime 'Dol-Se-Ah-Ttae'.)
<<endif>>
<<choice 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_긍2_영문 "What's that wallpaper? You into this kind of stuff?" 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_부2_영문 "(Don't ask)">>
(Should I ask if she likes anime?)
===

title: 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_긍2_영문
---
{name()}: What's with the wallpaper? Are you into this kind of stuff?
<<show pyo_shock>>
EunPyo: Oh, uh, well...
<<play 서은표_흠>>
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: I just... really like Japanese anime.
EunPyo: I totally forgot I had that set. It's a bit embarrassing.
{name()}: Why? It's fine.

<<if get("otk") >= 2>>
{name()}: I watch some from time to time, too.
{name()}: That's 'Dol-Se-Ah-Ttae', right? I enjoyed that one.
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
<<show pyo_shock>>
EunPyo: No way! {name()}, you know 'Dol-Se-Ah-Ttae'??
<<endif>>
<<show pyo_smile>>
(We spent some time talking about anime.)
(EunPyo seems to be quite a hardcore fan.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주1_월_3교시_강의실_서은표_부2_영문
---
(I decided not to ask, thinking it might be a private matter.)
(We chatted until the lecture began.)
<<end>>
===